                                                "sense_id": "42f3e282-afaa-3fa3-863e-9d3efe9a4b77",
                                                "text": "I'd been fighting him for ages, and then you stole my frag!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45560acb-fa78-4e59-94f8-c4b56940751e",
                                                "sense_id": "42f3e282-afaa-3fa3-863e-9d3efe9a4b77",
                                                "text": "Oh, man. Did you play Online Gaming last night? No, yeah, no? I did. I got so many frags."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
